            <ArticleTitle>Backpack as a daily load for schoolchildren.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1974</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>34.8% of Italian schoolchildren carry more than 30% of their bodyweight at least once a week, exceeding limits proposed for adults. Given increasing evidence of back pain in children, the time has come to propose some limitations to backpack load.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
